A trail in the otherwise harshly impenetrable jungle seems to open up for you 
along the paths east and west, the canopy sheltering you from the elements and
filling the air with a mystery, ancient and forgotten. Mist from the jungle 
fills the path ahead of you and obscures your vision along it. The jungle 
encroaches all around you, dark and threatening, urging you to continue along
the path you have discovered.
